# Winning the first GDI mission with the developers' Alt-W: the score screen,
# the hall of fame, the map on which the next territory is chosen, and the
# mission there. No shot is taken while the map dissolves in: the order of its
# pixels is random on purpose (Bit_It_In() in td/screens/mapsel.cc).
# args: -PLAYTEST
at 301 click 320 58
at 501 click 160 200
at 3000 keydown ALT
at 3001 key W
at 3005 keyup ALT
at 4000 shot score_counting
at 6000 shot hall_of_fame
at 6001 type AB
at 6020 key RETURN
at 9000 shot map_selection
at 9001 click 400 40
at 12000 shot territory
at 12001 click 320 200
at 16000 shot next_mission
at 16001 quit
